---
// The hero's signature element: the Nod inbox triaging itself, making the
// headline literal — the queue drains like mail, it doesn't get navigated
// like a website. Mirrors the real app's two-pane inbox: the list on the
// left drains while the reading pane on the right follows the cursor, and
// the key hints live in the window's own footer, exactly where the app puts
// them. One shared 12s pure-CSS loop, zero JS. Slots: rest on the full
// queue (badge 8, card 1 in the pane) -> Enter flashes and a "reviewed"
// chip pops on the top row (the review itself is elided; the footage
// sections below show it) -> E archives the row, it collapses inside the
// clipped list, the queue slides up under the cursor, the badge ticks down
// and the pane crossfades to the next PR -> the same beat repeats -> one j
// step -> long rest on the composed frame. The list viewport is fixed at
// six rows and the markup carries eight, so the frame stays full while rows
// leave; the page around the window never moves. The static markup IS the
// composed frame (badge 6, archived rows collapsed, cursor on the second
// visible row, card 4 in the pane), which is what prefers-reduced-motion
// shows. Keyframes carry the `ir-` prefix — Astro does not namespace them.
---

<figure
  class="ir"
  aria-label="The Nod inbox triaging itself: Enter opens a review request, E archives the reviewed one, the queue slides up, the count ticks down, and the reading pane follows the cursor."
>
  <div class="ir__window" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="ir__head">
      <span class="ir__tab">
        Review requests
        <span class="ir__badge mono">
          <span class="ir__badge-n ir__badge-n--8">8</span>
          <span class="ir__badge-n ir__badge-n--7">7</span>
          <span class="ir__badge-n ir__badge-n--6">6</span>
        </span>
      </span>
      <span class="ir__head-dim mono">acme/rocket</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ir__main">
      <div class="ir__list">
        <div class="ir__cursor"></div>
        <div class="ir__row ir__row--out1">
          <span class="ir__dot"></span>
          <span class="ir__title">Fix cursor drift in diff viewer</span>
          <span class="ir__chip mono">reviewed ✓</span>
          <span class="ir__meta mono">#62 · 1h</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ir__row ir__row--out2">
          <span class="ir__dot"></span>
          <span class="ir__title">Rework the token gate</span>
          <span class="ir__chip mono">reviewed ✓</span>
          <span class="ir__meta mono">#60 · 2h</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ir__row">
          <span class="ir__dot"></span>
          <span class="ir__title">Handle empty cache on open</span>
          <span class="ir__meta mono">#58 · 3h</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ir__row">
          <span class="ir__dot"></span>
          <span class="ir__title">Add fuzzy matching to search</span>
          <span class="ir__meta mono">#61 · 4h</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ir__row">
          <span class="ir__dot"></span>
          <span class="ir__title">Restore scroll position on relaunch</span>
          <span class="ir__meta mono">#57 · 5h</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ir__row">
          <span class="ir__dot"></span>
          <span class="ir__title">Quiet background refresh</span>
          <span class="ir__meta mono">#55 · 1d</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ir__row">
          <span class="ir__dot"></span>
          <span class="ir__title">Snapshot store for offline diffs</span>
          <span class="ir__meta mono">#54 · 1d</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ir__row">
          <span class="ir__dot"></span>
          <span class="ir__title">Keyboard map for review actions</span>
          <span class="ir__meta mono">#52 · 2d</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="ir__pane">
        <div class="ir__card ir__card--1">
          <div class="ir__card-top">
            <span class="ir__pill"><span class="ir__pill-dot"></span>Open</span>
            <span class="ir__card-num mono">#62</span>
          </div>
          <p class="ir__card-title">Fix cursor drift in diff viewer</p>
          <p class="ir__card-author">
            <span class="ir__avatar mono">bo</span>bob · 1h ago
          </p>
          <p class="ir__card-stat mono">
            2 files · <span class="ir__add">+12</span>
            <span class="ir__del">−3</span>
          </p>
          <p class="ir__card-desc">
            The cursor jumped a row whenever a hunk collapsed above it.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="ir__card ir__card--2">
          <div class="ir__card-top">
            <span class="ir__pill"><span class="ir__pill-dot"></span>Open</span>
            <span class="ir__card-num mono">#60</span>
          </div>
          <p class="ir__card-title">Rework the token gate</p>
          <p class="ir__card-author">
            <span class="ir__avatar mono">ca</span>carol · 2h ago
          </p>
          <p class="ir__card-stat mono">
            5 files · <span class="ir__add">+48</span>
            <span class="ir__del">−20</span>
          </p>
          <p class="ir__card-desc">
            Moves the token check fully into the Rust backend.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="ir__card ir__card--3">
          <div class="ir__card-top">
            <span class="ir__pill"><span class="ir__pill-dot"></span>Open</span>
            <span class="ir__card-num mono">#58</span>
          </div>
          <p class="ir__card-title">Handle empty cache on open</p>
          <p class="ir__card-author">
            <span class="ir__avatar mono">bo</span>bob · 3h ago
          </p>
          <p class="ir__card-stat mono">
            2 files · <span class="ir__add">+6</span>
            <span class="ir__del">−1</span>
          </p>
          <p class="ir__card-desc">
            A cold cache rendered an empty pane instead of the diff.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="ir__card ir__card--4">
          <div class="ir__card-top">
            <span class="ir__pill"><span class="ir__pill-dot"></span>Open</span>
            <span class="ir__card-num mono">#61</span>
          </div>
          <p class="ir__card-title">Add fuzzy matching to search</p>
          <p class="ir__card-author">
            <span class="ir__avatar mono">al</span>alice · 4h ago
          </p>
          <p class="ir__card-stat mono">
            3 files · <span class="ir__add">+32</span>
            <span class="ir__del">−4</span>
          </p>
          <p class="ir__card-desc">
            Subsequence matching for the inbox search field.
          </p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <div class="ir__foot mono">
      <span><kbd class="ir__key" data-k="jk">j k</kbd> move</span>
      <span><kbd class="ir__key" data-k="enter">↵</kbd> open review</span>
      <span><kbd class="ir__key" data-k="e">E</kbd> archive</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
